  "contracts": {
    "input": "Already checked virtual RGBA8 spans,row parity and Q16 weights. Resource/coordinate planning remains upstream.",
    "translation": "Four existing GraphicsAddressTranslator instances. Every nonzero-weight tap translates before any physical group dispatch;zero-weight taps alias an admitted active tap.",
    "VM": "One pinned SATP epoch through final retirement. Idle SATP changes automatically flush all four TLBs and the private texture cache;explicit scoped flushes require complete drain.",
    "faults": "Retain original virtual word,identity and tag for translation and data faults,including primary faults during cancellation.",
    "page_policy": "An uncached active page bypasses private resident data for the entire group and forwards uncached physical reads without cache installation. Cached/uncached fill joins remain separate.",
    "cancellation": "Global epoch cancel/invalidate drains accepted work;identity/tag cancel poisons matching rows only. One public completion remains immutable;completed hidden rows still observe cancellation.",
    "credits": "32 admission/result rows in addition to16 physical association slots/16 fills. Separate4-ID PTE port,16-ID physical data port,and registered PTE offers.",
    "rate": "96 complete resident groups at input/output II1 after nonidentity Sv32 warmup,192 additional backpressured groups,zero hot PTE/data reads."
  },
